eleventyNavigation:
    key: About
    order: 3
---

<section class="py-14 pb-[72px]">
    <h1 class="mb-3 font-serif text-[clamp(30px,5vw,42px)] tracking-tight text-ink">About Me</h1>
    <p class="mb-10 max-w-[560px] text-base leading-[1.65] text-ink2">
        Jay Bell — CTO &amp; Co-Founder of Trellis.org, Angular GDE, Nx Champion, podcaster.
    </p>

    <div class="prose-jay">
        <p>
            I'm the CTO and Co-Founder of
            <a href="https://trellis.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Trellis.org</a>, a social
            enterprise working to empower global collective impact. I've been steering Trellis's technical
            direction since its inception in 2018.
        </p>
        <p>
            Born and raised in Canada, I've dabbled in various entrepreneurial ventures, from drones to
            software and mobile apps. My passion for technology and innovation led me to co-found Trellis.org.
            I specialize in Nx, Angular, Nest, DevOps, CI/CD, startups, TypeScript, GraphQL, and NgRx — and
            I'm an active open-source contributor.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="things">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Things I do</span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-12 mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 border border-line max-sm:grid-cols-1">
        <div class="border-b border-r border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Podcast</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">The Angular Plus Show</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">The home of ng-conf's official all-Angular podcast. Listen on Spotify.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Hobby</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Horde 40k app</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">Warhammer 40k companion app built with Angular and Nx.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-r border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Community</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Angular GDE / Nx Champion</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">Helping grow the Angular and Nx communities through talks and open source.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Work</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">Trellis</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">
                Building software that has to hold up when it matters most.
                <a href="https://tech.trellis.org" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Read the Trellis Tech Blog →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-line p-5 max-sm:border-r-0 max-sm:border-b-0">
            <div class="mb-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-accent">Show</div>
            <div class="mb-1 text-sm font-medium text-ink">This is Tech Talks</div>
            <div class="text-xs leading-[1.5] text-ink3">A show about tech, software, and the people building it.</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 pb-7 pt-12 scroll-mt-20" id="links">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink3">Find me</span>
        <div class="h-px flex-1 bg-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 mt-2 flex flex-col border-t border-line">
        {% for link in links %}
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[140px_1fr] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-line py-[18px] max-sm:grid-cols-1 max-sm:gap-1">
                <span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink3">{{ link.label }}</span>
                <span class="text-[13px] text-ink2">
                    <a href="{{ link.href }}" {% if link.href | isExternal %}target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"{% endif %}>{{ link.text }}</a>
                    {% if link.note %} — {{ link.note }}{% endif %}
                </span>
            </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
</section>
